⚡🇺🇸 Former US President Joe Biden, 83, has visibly weakened amid treatment for prostate cancer with bone metastases, though the treatment is showing results, according to the Washington Post. Biden has largely withdrawn from public life, spending his time with close family, old friends, and aides.

He is expected to release his memoirs this fall and return to public appearances.

